  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "El fado",
    "@en": "The Fado"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "El **fado** es un género de música y poesía asociado a Lisboa; también existe el fado de Coimbra. Suele acompañarse de guitarra portuguesa. Sus letras tratan temas diversos, como la **saudade**, el amor y la vida diaria; no es siempre triste. En **ouve-se fado**, no se nombra a quien lo escucha.",
     "@en": "The **fado** is a genus of music and poetry associated with Lisbon; there is also the Fado of Coimbra. It is usually accompanied by Portuguese guitar. His lyrics deal with different topics, such as **saudade**, love and daily life; it is not always sad. In **ouve-se fado**, the listener is not named."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Tradiciones de estudiantes y de carnaval",
    "@en": "Student and Carnival Traditions"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "La **Queima das Fitas** es una festividad académica asociada a Coimbra, normalmente en primavera; las fechas cambian. El **Carnaval de Torres Vedras** es conocido por sus desfiles. Los **Açores** y la **Madeira** son archipiélagos portugueses.",
     "@en": "The **Queima das Fitas** is an academic holiday associated with Coimbra, usually in spring; dates change. The **Carnaval de Torres Vedras** is known for its parades. The **Açores** and the **Madeira** are Portuguese archipelagos."
    }
   ]
